## File Description

─ agent.py -> Contains the agent logic for loading tickets, creating tickets, changing ticket status, pending tickets by severity, tickets by status etc. and helper utilities.
─ backend.py -> Handles JSON processing and helper utilities.
─ app.py -> Streamlit UI for creating chat interface.
─ tickets.json -> Input file
─ requirements.txt -> relevant libraries for smooth exceution of the project.
─ .env -> API Key


## How to Run the Project

### 1. Install dependencies

Create a virtual environment and install required packages:
pip install -r requirements.txt

### 2. Create a .env file

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="your_key_here"

### 3. Run the Streamlit app

streamlit run app.py
